OL,3,AMaltese tycoon acquitted of
OL,4,Aorchestrating murder of renowned
OL,5,Ajournalist
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Maltese businessman on trial over the
OL,8,Fmurder of investigative journalist
OL,9,FDaphne Caruana Galizia has been
OL,10,Facquitted.
OL,12,FYorgen Fenech, 44, was accused of
OL,13,Fcomplicity in her murder and criminal
OL,14,Fassociation to commit murder. He denied
OL,15,Fall the charges.
OL,17,FIn 2022, brothers George and Alfred
OL,18,FDegiorgio were jailed for 40 years over
OL,19,Fthe killing of Caruana Galizia, who was
OL,20,Fan outspoken critic of the government
OL,21,Fand had uncovered networks of
OL,22,Fcorruption in Malta and abroad.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
